#: docs/cell-alpha-protocol.rst:2
msgid "Cell background alpha"
msgstr "字符单元背景透明度"

#: docs/cell-alpha-protocol.rst:6
msgid ""
"A program can draw images in the terminal, but it cannot draw text over them without hiding them,"
" because a cell background is always opaque. This extension lets a program make the background of"
" a cell translucent, so that whatever is beneath, the window background, a background image or an"
" image placed below the text, shows through. The usual use is a heads up display over a canvas or"
" a dimmed overlay behind a menu."
msgstr "程序可以在终端绘制图像，但在其上绘制文本时会遮住图像，因为字符单元背景始终不透明。本扩展让程序将单元背景设为半透明，使下方的窗口背景、背景图或位于文本下层的图像透出。典型用途是在画布上显示抬头信息，或在菜单后添加暗色蒙层。"

#: docs/cell-alpha-protocol.rst:14
msgid "Setting the alpha"
msgstr "设置不透明度"

#: docs/cell-alpha-protocol.rst:16
msgid ""
"A new SGR attribute sets the opacity of the background of subsequently written cells, as a "
"percent, using the colon sub-parameter form::"
msgstr "新的 SGR 属性使用冒号子参数形式，以百分比设置后续写入字符单元的背景不透明度：::"

#: docs/cell-alpha-protocol.rst:21
msgid ""
"``100`` is opaque, which is the default, and ``0`` is fully transparent. For example, to show "
"text on a red background that is thirty percent opaque::"
msgstr "默认值 ``100`` 表示不透明，``0`` 表示完全透明。例如，在不透明度为百分之三十的红色背景上显示文本：::"

#: docs/cell-alpha-protocol.rst:26
msgid ""
"The alpha is independent of how the background color was chosen. It applies to colors set with "
"``48``, to the sixteen basic colors, to colors from the 256 color palette and to the default "
"background, and it stays in effect when the background color is changed. It is reset by "
"``<ESC>[0m``, by ``70`` without a sub-parameter, and by a value of ``100`` or more. Values are "
"rounded down to even percentages. The percent is only recognized as a colon sub-parameter, "
"``<ESC>[70;30m`` is ``70`` with no value followed by an unrelated parameter."
msgstr ""
"此属性独立于背景色的选择方式，适用于 ``48`` 设置的颜色、十六种基本色、256 色调色板中的颜色，以及默认背景；背景色改变时仍然生效。``<ESC>[0m``、不带子参数的 "
"``70``，或 ``100`` 及以上的值会重置此属性。百分比向下取整到偶数。百分比只在冒号子参数中识别；``<ESC>[70;30m`` 表示无值的 ``70``，后接一个无关参数。"

#: docs/cell-alpha-protocol.rst:35
msgid ""
"The translucent background is blended over whatever the terminal draws beneath the cell: the "
"window background including its own transparency, a background image, and images placed below the"
" text with a negative z-index. Cells under the cursor, selected cells and cells with reverse "
"video are drawn opaque, as they are today, and under reverse video the alpha is ignored since the"
" background color is being used as the foreground. The foreground text, underlines and "
"strikethrough are not affected."
msgstr ""
"半透明背景会与终端在单元下方绘制的内容混合：窗口背景（含自身透明度）、背景图，以及以负 z-index "
"放置在文本下层的图像。光标下方、被选中或反显的字符单元仍按现有方式绘制为不透明；反显时因背景色用作前景，透明度被忽略。前景文本、下划线和删除线不受影响。"

#: docs/cell-alpha-protocol.rst:44
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr "兼容性"

#: docs/cell-alpha-protocol.rst:46
msgid ""
"Terminals that do not know this attribute ignore it, since that is what most terminals do with "
"unknown SGR parameters and their sub-parameters, so a program can emit it unconditionally and get"
" an opaque background elsewhere. A terminal that drops a whole SGR sequence containing an unknown"
" parameter would also lose any color set in the same sequence, so send the alpha in its own "
"``<ESC>[...m`` after the color, as in the example above."
msgstr ""
"不认识此属性的终端会忽略它，因为多数终端都会忽略未知 SGR 参数及子参数，所以程序可无条件发送，在其他终端上得到不透明背景。如果终端会丢弃含未知参数的整个 SGR "
"序列，同一序列中的颜色设置也会丢失。因此，如上例所示，应在设置颜色之后，用独立的 ``<ESC>[...m`` 发送透明度。"

#: docs/cell-alpha-protocol.rst:53
msgid ""
"In kitty the attribute is stored with the background color of the cell and survives everything "
"the color survives: scrollback, copying with formatting, and ``DECRQSS`` reports of the current "
"SGR state, which include ``70:<percent>`` when the alpha is not 100."
msgstr ""
"kitty 将此属性与字符单元背景色一起保存，凡背景色能保留的地方都会保留它，包括回滚、带格式复制，以及当前 SGR 状态的 ``DECRQSS`` 报告；当不透明度不是 100 时，报告包含 "
"``70:<percent>``。"

